      "id": "02",
      "title": "GO! operates passively — Preet only touches one device",
      "type": "insight",
      "data": {
        "insight": {
          "text": "The Iridium GO! functions as a passive satellite hotspot. Once configured before departure it runs in the background for the entire expedition — no direct interaction required in the field. The only device Preet physically handles on the ice is the Extreme. Two devices in the kit. One device in her hands.",
